{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v2",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "${dash_bedrock}"
  },
  "spec": {
    "title": "Observing Bedrock (${prefix})",
    "description": "What Amazon Bedrock itself records for the demo: invocation logs (opt-in), the app's own OpenTelemetry against the invocation log, and AWS/Bedrock CloudWatch metrics.",
    "tags": [
      "${prefix}",
      "bedrock",
      "ai-observability"
    ],
    "editable": true,
    "liveNow": false,
    "preload": false,
    "cursorSync": "Crosshair",
    "timeSettings": {
      "from": "now-3h",
      "to": "now",
      "timezone": "browser",
      "autoRefresh": "1m"
    },
    "links": [],
    "annotations": [],
    "variables": [],
    "elements": {
      "t1-intro": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 1,
          "title": "",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": true,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "**What Bedrock itself recorded.** When `bedrock_invocation_logging_enabled` is on, every `bedrock-runtime` call in this account and region lands in the Bedrock model invocation log (`${invocation_log_group}`, streamed to Loki by Firehose) with the full prompt, the answer, the token counts and the caller. ${invocation_logging_note} **Attribution:** every in-app agent assumes the same IAM role, and the EKS Pod Identity session name carries only the cluster and namespace, so the caller identifies the role, not the agent. The **application inference profile** (one per team and model) carries team and model. That is how AWS-side cost gets split per team without a gateway. Logging is account-wide and captures prompt text, so turning it on is a security decision."
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-calls": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 2,
          "title": "Invocations",
          "description": "Rows in the Bedrock invocation log over the dashboard range.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum(count_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} [$__range]))",
                        "queryType": "instant",
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "stat",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": false
                },
                "colorMode": "background",
                "graphMode": "none",
                "justifyMode": "center",
                "textMode": "value",
                "orientation": "auto"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "fixed",
                    "fixedColor": "blue"
                  },
                  "noValue": "0"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-in": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 3,
          "title": "Input tokens",
          "description": "inputTokenCount summed over the range.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum(sum_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` | unwrap itok [$__range]))",
                        "queryType": "instant",
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "stat",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": false
                },
                "colorMode": "background",
                "graphMode": "none",
                "justifyMode": "center",
                "textMode": "value",
                "orientation": "auto"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "fixed",
                    "fixedColor": "purple"
                  },
                  "noValue": "0"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-out": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 4,
          "title": "Output tokens",
          "description": "outputTokenCount summed over the range.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum(sum_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` | unwrap otok [$__range]))",
                        "queryType": "instant",
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "stat",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": false
                },
                "colorMode": "background",
                "graphMode": "none",
                "justifyMode": "center",
                "textMode": "value",
                "orientation": "auto"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "fixed",
                    "fixedColor": "orange"
                  },
                  "noValue": "0"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-p95": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 5,
          "title": "Model latency p95",
          "description": "output.metrics.latencyMs as Bedrock reports it, all profiles.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, ${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` | unwrap lat [$__range]) by ()",
                        "queryType": "instant",
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "stat",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": false
                },
                "colorMode": "background",
                "graphMode": "none",
                "justifyMode": "center",
                "textMode": "value",
                "orientation": "auto"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "ms",
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "fixed",
                    "fixedColor": "green"
                  },
                  "noValue": "-"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-by-profile": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 6,
          "title": "Calls by team / model (inference profile)",
          "description": "Application inference profile id mapped to team and model.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum by (profile) (count_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` [$__interval]))",
                        "queryType": "range",
                        "refId": "A",
                        "legendFormat": "{{profile}}"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "sum"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "custom": {
                    "drawStyle": "bars",
                    "stacking": {
                      "mode": "normal"
                    },
                    "fillOpacity": 80
                  }
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-tokens": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 7,
          "title": "Tokens by team / model",
          "description": "Input + output tokens per profile.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum by (profile) (sum_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` | unwrap itok [$__interval]))",
                        "queryType": "range",
                        "refId": "A",
                        "legendFormat": "{{profile}} in"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "B",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum by (profile) (sum_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` | unwrap otok [$__interval]))",
                        "queryType": "range",
                        "refId": "B",
                        "legendFormat": "{{profile}} out"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "sum"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-lat": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 8,
          "title": "Latency p95 by team / model",
          "description": "Bedrock-reported model latency.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, ${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` | unwrap lat [15m]) by (profile)",
                        "queryType": "range",
                        "refId": "A",
                        "legendFormat": "{{profile}}"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "mean",
                    "max"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "ms"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-region": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 9,
          "title": "Where the call actually ran",
          "description": "inferenceRegion. The app calls eu-west-1, but the EU cross-region inference profile served it elsewhere in the EU. Data residency is EU, not Ireland.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum by (region) (count_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` [$__range]))",
                        "queryType": "instant",
                        "refId": "A",
                        "legendFormat": "{{region}}"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "piechart",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "values": [
                    "value",
                    "percent"
                  ]
                },
                "pieType": "donut",
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "displayName": "$${__field.labels.region}",
                  "unit": "short"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-caller": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 10,
          "title": "Which IAM role called, and as which team / model",
          "description": "identity.arn: shown as the IAM role name. All in-app agents assume one role through EKS Pod Identity and the session name carries no agent, so this splits the agents role from the gateway's agent-host role. Team and model come from the application inference profile.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum by (agent, profile) (count_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` [$__range]))",
                        "queryType": "instant",
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [
                {
                  "id": "reduce",
                  "options": {
                    "reducers": [
                      "lastNotNull"
                    ],
                    "labelsToFields": true
                  }
                }
              ],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "table",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "showHeader": true
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-stop": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 11,
          "title": "Stop reasons",
          "description": "output.stopReason. max_tokens would mean truncated answers.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum by (stop) (count_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}`, stop=`{{ or .stop \"none\" }}` [$__range]))",
                        "queryType": "instant",
                        "refId": "A",
                        "legendFormat": "{{stop}}"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "piechart",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "values": [
                    "value",
                    "percent"
                  ]
                },
                "pieType": "donut",
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "displayName": "$${__field.labels.stop}",
                  "unit": "short"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t1-logs": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 12,
          "title": "Recent invocations with prompt and answer",
          "description": "The content boundary: this is the prompt text Bedrock logged.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", q=\"input.inputBodyJson.messages[0].content[0].text\", a=\"output.outputBodyJson.output.message.content[0].text\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", region=\"inferenceRegion\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` | line_format `[{{.profile}} | {{.region}} | {{.itok}} in / {{.otok}} out]  Q: {{.q}}  A: {{.a}}`",
                        "queryType": "range",
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "logs",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "showTime": true,
                "wrapLogMessage": true,
                "sortOrder": "Descending",
                "enableLogDetails": true,
                "dedupStrategy": "none"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t2-intro": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 13,
          "title": "",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": true,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "**Two views of the same calls.** The left panel is what the *application* recorded through OpenTelemetry for every agent; the right is what *Bedrock's invocation log* recorded, per team and model. They should agree on volume. Bedrock sees tokens, latency, region and prompt text, but not the conversation, the agent's tool calls or the evaluation scores: those only exist in the app's own telemetry and Agent Observability."
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t2-app": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 14,
          "title": "Generations the app recorded (OTel, per agent)",
          "description": "gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count by service over the range.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "round(sum by (service_name) (increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\"}[$__range])))",
                        "range": false,
                        "instant": true,
                        "refId": "A",
                        "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "bargauge",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "orientation": "horizontal",
                "displayMode": "basic",
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t2-bedrock": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 15,
          "title": "Rows Bedrock logged (per team / model)",
          "description": "Invocation-log rows by application inference profile over the range.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "expr": "sum by (profile) (count_over_time(${bedrock_log_selector} | json pid=\"modelId\", itok=\"input.inputTokenCount\", otok=\"output.outputTokenCount\", lat=\"output.outputBodyJson.metrics.latencyMs\", region=\"inferenceRegion\", caller=\"identity.arn\", stop=\"output.outputBodyJson.stopReason\", op=\"operation\" | label_format pid=`{{ regexReplaceAll \".*/\" .pid \"\" }}`, agent=`{{ regexReplaceAll \"${agent_caller_re}\" .caller \"$${1}\" }}` | label_format profile=`${profile_chain}` [$__range]))",
                        "queryType": "instant",
                        "refId": "A",
                        "legendFormat": "{{profile}}"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "bargauge",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "orientation": "horizontal",
                "displayMode": "basic",
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t3-intro": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 16,
          "title": "",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": true,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "**AWS/Bedrock CloudWatch metrics**, streamed into this stack by a CloudWatch metric stream (`${metric_stream_name}`) when `bedrock_metric_stream_enabled` is on. These are AWS's own per-ModelId counters, covering every API path in the account. Metric-stream `_sum` series are per-period values: this dashboard uses `sum_over_time`, never `rate()`."
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t3-inv": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 17,
          "title": "Invocations by ModelId",
          "description": "aws_bedrock_invocations_sum.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "sum by (dimension_ModelId) (sum_over_time(aws_bedrock_invocations_sum[$__interval]))",
                        "range": true,
                        "instant": false,
                        "refId": "A",
                        "legendFormat": "{{dimension_ModelId}}"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "sum"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "noValue": "metric stream not yet delivering"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "t3-tok": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 18,
          "title": "Input / output tokens by ModelId",
          "description": "aws_bedrock_input_token_count_sum and aws_bedrock_output_token_count_sum.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
